B6  THE KHRONON'S CHARACTERISTIC CONE (decoupling limit, from XC1 A1), and the alpha_c -> 0 control
==============================================================================================================
    symbol k^2 (alpha_c w^2 - c_2 k^2): real roots w/k = sqrt(c_2)/sqrt(alpha_c)  (finite cone for alpha_c > 0)
    alpha_c = 0: symbol = -c_2*k**4; contains omega: False  -> no time derivative: the lapse is elliptic on each leaf
